sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as Data Owner / Release Authority
    participant Session as Owner CPU HESession
    participant Backend as OpenFHE Backend
    actor Analyst as Result Recipient
    participant Release as Result Release Model
    participant Artifacts as Release / Workspace Artifacts

    Owner->>Session: create_result_recipient()
    Session->>Backend: create second key pair in owner context
    Backend-->>Release: recipient ID + public key + secret key
    Release-->>Owner: ResultRecipient

    Owner->>Release: recipient.save_public_key(path)
    Release->>Artifacts: save recipient public key + checksum manifest
    Artifacts-->>Analyst: public-key artifact only
    Note over Release,Analyst: In a real exchange, the analyst retains the<br/>recipient secret key and shares only the public key.

    Analyst-->>Owner: recipient public-key artifact
    Owner->>Session: load_recipient_public_key(path)
    Session->>Artifacts: validate manifest, checksum and context
    Artifacts-->>Session: RecipientPublicKey

    Owner->>Session: sum(), mean(), or variance()
    Session->>Backend: calculate aggregate under owner key
    Backend-->>Session: EncryptedScalar with operation provenance

    Owner->>Session: reencrypt_for_recipient(aggregate, public_key)
    Session->>Session: require scalar + approved operation + compatible recipient
    Session->>Backend: generate PRE key and re-encrypt ciphertext
    Backend-->>Release: ciphertext in recipient key domain
    Release-->>Owner: ReleasedResult

    Owner->>Session: save(released_result, workspace, name)
    Session->>Artifacts: persist ciphertext, recipient ID and checksum
    Artifacts-->>Analyst: released-result workspace/artifact

    Analyst->>Release: recipient.load(workspace, name)
    Release->>Artifacts: validate recipient ID, metadata and checksum
    Artifacts-->>Release: ReleasedResult
    Analyst->>Release: recipient.decrypt(released_result)
    Release->>Backend: decrypt with recipient secret key
    Backend-->>Analyst: aggregate plaintext number

    Note over Owner,Analyst: The recipient cannot decrypt the owner's original input ciphertext.
    Note over Session,Backend: Result release is currently an OpenFHE CPU trial.<br/>FIDES GPU PRE is not implemented.
